# The pressed look of the touch clipboard bubble's last button: the pressed fill must stay inside the 1 px outline
# at the rounded outer corners (holdbubble keeps the finger down for the shot; the release then acts as a tap). Review only.
title text field: pressed bubble, last button
review
sizes 800x480 480x320
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_OSK force
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
clipboard server on
clipboard set "from elsewhere"
fielddemo
wait 300
expect_osk shown
expect_handles Name none
expect_bubble Name none
tapchar Name 4
expect_caret Name 4
expect_handles Name caret
expect_bubble Name none
expect_osk shown
taphandle Name caret
expect_bubble Name "Select all|Paste"
expect_editing Name on
expect_osk shown
taphandle Name caret
expect_bubble Name none
expect_handles Name caret
expect_editing Name on
taphandle Name caret
expect_bubble Name "Select all|Paste"
tapbubble Name "Select all"
expect_selection Name 0 16
expect_handles Name range
expect_bubble Name "Cut|Copy|Paste"
expect_editing Name on
expect_osk shown
holdbubble Name Paste
shot press_last
release
